/target/
/.tools/

# Native runtime binaries supplied by Xdows-Model are not redistributed here.
*.dll
*.exp
*.lib

# Model metadata is embedded into the crate via include_bytes! and tracked here.
# The recommended-threshold manifests are part of the deployment contract: the
# native library reads <model>.threshold.json to obtain the recommended
# threshold that defines the Suspicious band, so they must ship with the models.
*.threshold.json
!models/*.threshold.json

# ONNX models are embedded into the crate via include_bytes! and tracked here.
# Ignore stray runtime ONNX files everywhere except the bundled models/ directory.
*.onnx
!models/*.onnx
